{
  "id": "step_ana_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "Hay by the load, girth straps, salt, and a woman who has already worked out what you forgot to bring."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hay, salt, strap, or rope. It is always one of the four.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "step_ana_ford",
          "text": "The camp at the crossing. Why is it there?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "step_bank_ford"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                12,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_horse_lords",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "step_ana_ford_told",
            "onFailure": "step_ana_ford_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "step_ana_courses",
          "text": "What is showing in the open face?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "step_bank_courses"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "craft",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                14,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_horse_lords",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "step_ana_courses_told",
            "onFailure": "step_ana_courses_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step_ana_ford_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Because it has always been there.” Ana stacks something. “Nine hundred years of hearths, one on top of the last. And there is no crossing — it is dry eleven months, and the twelfth you would not put a horse in it.” She stops stacking. “Nobody has ever *needed* to camp at that spot. They camp there anyway.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "step_bank_ford"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "step_ana_ford_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step_ana_ford_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_horse_lords",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "step_ana_ford_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step_ana_courses_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Stone.” She says it like it is an inconvenience. “Forty foot down, courses of it, dressed, laid level, going both ways into the bank.” A hand out flat. “Not fallen. Not washed. Laid. My father took a block out and it is my doorstep, and you can see the chisel on it.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "step_bank_courses"
          }
        }
